WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:04.498 --> 00:01:07.534
Half the dwellings
on a twentieth of the space.

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:09.503
-What are you going to do about it?
-Knock them down.

00:01:39.533 --> 00:01:42.402
It's like being in heaven up here

00:01:42.803 --> 00:01:46.039
because we've always
been poor people.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:10.898
It's exciting coming into
a place with an upstairs

00:02:11.298 --> 00:02:13.300
'cause I'd never had
an upstairs before.

